('notable_npc', 'overlord-necroskull', 'Eye plasma bolt', '2D6 M.D.', 1, '2,000 feet (610 m)', 'Unlimited; each counts as one attack. For P.P.E. per blast: 4D6 M.D. (10), 6D6 M.D. (15), 1D4x10 M.D. (20) or 1D6x10 M.D. (40).', 3),
('notable_npc', 'overlord-necroskull', 'Fire breath', '5D6 M.D.', 1, '40 feet (12.2 m)', 'Once per melee.', 4),
